# Screenshots and scratch images dropped at the repo root while working.
# This repository is public, and hosting-panel screenshots carry account
# usernames, server IPs and SSH ports. Real site imagery lives in public/ and
# source-images/, which these patterns deliberately do not touch.
/Screenshot*.png
/Screenshot*.jpg
